WEB SOURCE (parity target)
  web/src/features/onboarding/components/NoVehicleSelected.tsx
  A defensive guard: when a page mounts while useSelectedVehicle().vehicleId is null
  (deep-link before the onboarding poll resolves, or a Tesla token revoked between
  visits) it renders PageContainer(title) > GlassPanel(p-8) > EmptyState(Car glyph,
  title, message, action -> navigate('/onboarding')) instead of the page's data
  scaffolding. Hooks: useSelectedVehicle, useTranslation, useNavigate.
  i18n keys (verbatim, reproduced in the native surface):
    common.noVehicleSelected.title  = "No vehicle selected"
    common.noVehicleSelected.desc   = "Add a vehicle to your fleet to see data on this page."
    common.noVehicleSelected.action = "Set up TeslaSync"

