STATE MATRIX (every state renders; never a blank box)
  loading  -> selection resolving             -> skeleton chrome
  empty    -> resolved, NO vehicle (web null)  -> THE web EmptyState (Car + copy + onboarding CTA)
  content  -> resolved, vehicle selected       -> "vehicle ready" confirmation
  error    -> selection read failed            -> retry notice (QueryError equivalent)
  stale/offline freshness overlay              -> freshness chip + cached-data banner

ARCHITECTURE: binds via shared state-holder seam (P1/S8); NO HTTP in the view.
Telemetry view.opened slug "NoVehicleSelected" (P1/S11). Strings via P1/S10 facade
(no English literals in code paths). Tokens via P1/S9 (TSSpacing/TSRadius/Color.TS/
